{
 "collection": {
  "description": "The National Map 1:25,000 is a topographic map of Switzerland representing the areas of traffic and settlements, the topography and the vegetation in great detail. The map perimeter is divided into 247 individual sheets. The map content is updated in a regular six-year cycle according to a revision plan dividing Switzerland in six sectors. The National Map 1:25,000 is published in analogue format as a printed map and in digital format as the Swiss Map Raster.",
